Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:07.76,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:07.76,Campus Common,学園長,0,0,0,,『Hatsuboshi IDOL FESTIVAL』\n優勝者は――
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.29,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.29,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,プロデューサーさん。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:18.13,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:18.13,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,いつか、約束しましたよね。\nもう『負けた』とは言わないって。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.23,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.23,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,約束を破ります。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:25.32,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:25.32,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,今日は、あたしの負け、です。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:28.54,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:28.54,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,人生で一番の、大敗北です。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:33.73,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:33.73,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,はじめてです……\nこんなに爽やかな気持ちなのに。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:36.36,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:36.36,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,<em\=>それ</em>がすごくイヤだ……！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.84,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.84,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,勝ちたいです……\nプロデューサーさん……！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:42.43,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:42.43,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,このままで終わるもんか！！！
